cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this catalogue, please cite it as below, and cite each original dataset you use."
title: "Open Battery Data: a catalogue and map of open lithium-ion battery datasets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Son
    given-names: Soyoun
repository-code: "https://github.com/soyounson/open-battery-data"
url: "https://soyounson.github.io/open-battery-data/"
abstract: >-
  A curated catalogue of open lithium-ion battery datasets for EV and battery
  research: EV field telemetry, lab cell degradation, thermal-runaway tests and
  EV / ESS fire records, with chemistry, signals, charging C-rate, access and
  download links, shown on an interactive globe.
keywords:
  - battery
  - lithium-ion
  - electric vehicle
  - battery degradation
  - state of health
  - LFP
  - NMC
  - thermal runaway
  - open data
date-released: "2026-11-23"
